\par\par \uc2 Business/Financial Desk; SECTB\par \b \uc2 Political Groups Won't Get Gifts From Operator Of Dating Sites\b0\par\par\uc2 By Emma Goldberg \par \uc2 364 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 July 2022\par \uc2 The New York Times\par \uc2 NYTF\par \uc2 Late Edition - Final\par 5\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 The New York Times Company.  All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 The operator of Tinder, Hinge and other dating sites said it would no longer give money to groups representing Republican and Democratic attorneys general.\par \par \uc2 Facing scrutiny for donations to the Republican Attorneys General Association, whose members supported the overturning of Roe v. Wade, \uc2 Match Group\uc2  says it will suspend further contributions to the association as well as the Democratic Attorneys General Association.\par \par \uc2 Match Group\uc2 , a Texas-based company that operates dating sites like Tinder and Hinge, has been among the most vocal companies in responding to the Supreme Court's ruling in Dobbs v. Jackson, which ended nearly 50 years of federal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights. The company said it would cover \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -related travel for its employees, and its former chief executive \uc2 Shar Dubey\uc2  announced a fund in September supporting \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access in partnership with Planned Parenthood Los Angeles.\par \par \uc2 But \uc2 Match Group\uc2  was also among the companies that recently came under fire for previous support of the Republican Attorneys General Association. \uc2 Match Group\uc2  donated more than $100,000 to the association last year, along with more than $100,000 to the Democratic Attorneys General Association. Companies often give equally to both the Republican and Democratic groups.\par \par \uc2 Bernard Kim\uc2 , the company's chief executive, said he would suspend donations to both groups.\par \par \uc2 ''I learned about the donations to RAGA the same way most of you did, when I saw it in the media,'' Mr. Kim wrote in a recent memo to staff. ''It's my responsibility to understand how these donations fit into our larger lobbying activity, and determine what we will do moving forward.''\par \par \uc2 The company also promised to fight legal requests or subpoenas for any employee or user data related to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . This commitment comes as many companies, especially digital payment ones, face questions over what steps they will take to protect users when prosecutors seek transaction data during \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  investigations.\par \par \uc2 Tinder, the dating app owned by Match Group, which has been vocal in responding to the Supreme Court's ruling that ended federal \uc2  rights. (PHOTOGRAPH BY Akhtar Soomro/Reuters FOR THE NEW YORK TIMES) \par \par \uc2 Document NYTF000020220708ei7800042\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw284\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal4260\pichgoal600
