\par\par \uc2 Business/Financial Desk; SECTB\par \b \uc2 Google\uc2  Says It'll Delete Location Data Of Visits by Users to  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  Clinics\b0\par\par\uc2 By Nico Grant \par \uc2 531 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 July 2022\par \uc2 The New York Times\par \uc2 NYTF\par \uc2 Late Edition - Final\par 3\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 The New York Times Company.  All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Under pressure from employees and supporters of \b \highlight22\uc2 reproductive rights\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the company announced privacy changes for the post-Roe era.\par \par \uc2 SAN FRANCISCO -- \uc2 Google\uc2  said on Friday that it would delete \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinic visits from the location history of its users, in the company's first effort to address how it will handle sensitive data in the wake of the Supreme Court overturning Roe v. Wade.\par \par \uc2 The location data change will take place in the coming weeks, Jen Fitzpatrick, a \uc2 Google\uc2  senior vice president, wrote in a blog post. The policy will also apply to trips to fertility clinics, domestic violence shelters, addiction treatment facilities and other sensitive locations.\par \par \uc2 Google\uc2 , which holds reams of intimate information about its billions of users, has come under scrutiny since the Supreme Court's decision last week to strike down Roe v. Wade, eliminating the constitutional right to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after almost 50 years. Some supporters of \b \highlight22\uc2 reproductive rights\b0 \highlight\uc2  have pushed people to delete apps that track their menstrual cycles online, while experts said search and location data from companies like \uc2 Google\uc2  are more likely to be used as evidence.\par \par \uc2 The overturning of Roe has more broadly renewed questions about how much data and digital trails people have produced, which could be used to surveil or target those who try and get an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . In states that allow bans or other limits on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , law enforcement is expected to be focused on taking action against medical providers, but information about individuals -- including location data, payments data and more -- is not hard to obtain through data brokers and other sources.\par \par \uc2 The Alphabet Workers Union, a group representing more than 800 people who work for \uc2 Google\uc2 's parent company, \uc2 Alphabet\uc2 , demanded on Tuesday that the search giant delete any personal data that law enforcement could try to use to prosecute those who are getting abortions.\par \par \uc2 With Friday's announcement, while \uc2 Google\uc2  will delete some location data, it did not commit to automatically deleting search records about abortions, which may also become sought after. Users must individually opt to delete their search history.\par \par \uc2 Google\uc2  has been sued by the state of Texas, accused of continuing to track users even when they use the Chrome web browsers' supposedly private Incognito Mode -- which may further erode confidence that the company will purge all data when people try to browse privately.\par \par \uc2 Google\uc2  also made no commitments about changing the way it handles government data requests.\par \par \uc2 ''We remain committed to protecting our users against improper government demands for data, and we will continue to oppose demands that are overly broad or otherwise legally objectionable,'' Ms. Fitzpatrick wrote.\par \par \uc2 The company also said that users will soon be able to more quickly delete multiple menstruation logs stored on \uc2 Fitbit\uc2 , a health-tracking company owned by \uc2 Google\uc2 , rather than one at a time. The company also reminded users to employ existing settings options on \uc2 Google\uc2  to improve their online privacy.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2  data policy will also apply to trips to other sensitive locations like domestic violence shelters. (PHOTOGRAPH BY ANNA ROSE LAYDEN FOR THE NEW YORK TIMES) \par \par \uc2 Document NYTF000020220702ei720003p\par }\par \b \uc2 Search Summary\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9360\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 rst=nytf AND (abortion OR "reproductive rights" OR "reproductive health") AND (atleast5(abortion) OR atleast3("reproductive rights"))\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9360\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9360\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Date\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/2021 to 06/30/2026\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9360\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9360\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Source\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjust